{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n件件爆餡!炙燒和牛他他+肥美帆立貝\n</p>\n<h2>中環日式壽司手卷吧！</h2>\n<p>中環又有話題餐廳！Black Sheep 旗下全新日式壽司手卷吧 NICE NORI 即日起快閃登陸蘇豪區，期間限定營業到今年年底。由客席主廚 Daniel Garner坐鎮，佢鑽研日本料理近二十年，曾經喺邁阿密人氣餐廳 Makoto Bal Harbour 同加州 Nobu Malibu 掌廚，兩間都係當地一位難求嘅餐廳。店內海鮮大部分來自日本豐洲及九州市場，每件手卷都用上新潟米和日本九州有明海苔，保證海苔送到客人手上時依然香脆。</p>\n<h2>必食炙燒和牛他他配鵪鶉蛋手卷</h2>\n<p>餐牌主打三款手卷套餐，每款包三件即點即製手卷。想食經典口味可以揀「Nice」套餐（$348），有吞拿魚他他、辣油甘魚同辣三文魚；想風味明亮啲，推介「Very Nice」套餐（$448），包括深海池魚、北海道帆立貝和加州雪蟹；用料最豐富有「Super Nice」套餐（$548），焦點有炙燒和牛他他配鵪鶉蛋、北海道海膽、吞拿魚腩手卷，款款爆多餡，層次極豐富。</p>\n<p>NICE NORI<br/>\n地址：香港中環伊利近街 31 號  電話：<a>2488 8863</a><br/>\n營業時間:星期二至日，晚上 6 時至 11 時<br/>\n官方IG：@nicenorihk</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082437396845_7154481206b013378b9a2f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082437396845_7154481206b013378b9a2f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082670622798_9029938086b01337b0c733.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082670622798_9029938086b01337b0c733.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082912643576_18920590456b01337d8f5f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524082912643576_18920590456b01337d8f5f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083079437658_7649236856b01337f2e112.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083079437658_7649236856b01337f2e112.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083284316509_17001418346b0133812517e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083284316509_17001418346b0133812517e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083430262237_17814595976b013382a803d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524083430262237_17814595976b013382a803d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df_RRF1k97N/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.733834+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":655,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:00:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:22.664838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:27.979220+00:00","content_hash":"106787c5dc523b6dc1f1d15ffe0ac5da9d7634bf75d05ef55c0c5b9fbc6a4afc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}